  "notes": "{気|き}をつける is a common expression meaning \"to be careful.\"\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- Conjugates as ichidan verb: ⟦{気|き}をつけて→気をつけて：01080_kiwotsukete⟧ (te-form), ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧をつけます (polite)\n- Often followed by ⟦ください→下さい：02899_kudasai⟧ as a polite request\n- [noun]⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{気|き}をつける: to be careful of [noun]\n- ⟦{気|き}をつけて→気をつけて：01080_kiwotsukete⟧: Take care! (parting phrase)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{注意|ちゅうい}→注意：01464_chuui⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to pay attention, to warn\n- ⟦{用心|ようじん}→用心：03659_youjin⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to be cautious",
